    {
      "block_id": "p-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "This document maps the Rig Relay session lifecycle. It identifies the sequence of events and file emissions required to reconstruct a session from its evidence trail.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "State Machine Diagram",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-6",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "mermaid",
      "content": "stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> CREATED: session_id generated\n    CREATED --> READY: AgentLoop initialized\n    READY --> TURN_START: user prompt / resume\n    \n    state TURN_PROCESS {\n        TURN_START --> CONTEXT_ASSEMBLY: build blocks\n        CONTEXT_ASSEMBLY --> REQUEST_SENT: backend call\n        REQUEST_SENT --> RESPONSE_RECEIVED: stream/chunk\n        RESPONSE_RECEIVED --> TOOL_EXECUTION: tool call\n        TOOL_EXECUTION --> TURN_END: tool result\n        RESPONSE_RECEIVED --> TURN_END: final message\n    }\n    \n    TURN_END --> TURN_START: next turn\n    TURN_END --> CLOSED: session exit\n    CLOSED --> [*]",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Event/State Table",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-8",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "State",
        "Event Emitted",
        "Files Produced"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "**CREATED**",
          "`SESSION_STARTED`",
          "`observability.jsonl` (init)"
        ],
        [
          "**CONTEXT_ASSEMBLY**",
          "`CONTEXT_ASSEMBLY_REPORTED`",
          "`context/assembly_*.json`"
        ],
        [
          "**CONTEXT_ASSEMBLY**",
          "`CONTEXT_LAYOUT_PLANNED`",
          "`context/layout_*.json`"
        ],
        [
          "**REQUEST_SENT**",
          "`REQUEST_ACCOUNTED` (init)",
          "N/A"
        ],
        [
          "**TOOL_EXECUTION**",
          "`ARTIFACT_WRITTEN`",
          "`artifacts/tool-results/*.json`"
        ],
        [
          "**TURN_END**",
          "`TURN_SUMMARY`",
          "N/A"
        ],
        [
          "**CLOSED**",
          "`SESSION_CLOSED`",
          "Finalized JSONL"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Missing Transition List",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- **RECOVERY**: No current state for \"Resuming a session with broken evidence\". - **ABORT**: User cancellation is handled as a message, but not as a formal state transition that ensures evidence finalization.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Failure-Mode Inventory",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- **Provider Timeout**: Session stays in `REQUEST_SENT`. - **Tool Crash**: `TOOL_EXECUTION` emits an error event but must still reach `TURN_END`. - **Disk Full**: Evidence writing fails; session should probably enter a read-only `ERROR` state.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Recommended Tests",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- `test_lifecycle_recovers_from_early_exit` - `test_mandatory_events_present_on_completion`",
      "disclosure": {
